    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00fee Wi\u00fe banece eft to drence, elene, cneowholen, wealwyrt, hune, cluf\u00feung, gecnuwa, do on w\u00e6ter \u00fe\u00e6t Wyrc \u00feonne sealfe of tuning wyrte, of eolonan, of \u00feunge, of wermode, do ealra emfela, wylle Gif mannes getawa beo\u00fe sare o\u00f0\u00f0e a\u00feundene, betonican getrifula on wine, be\u00fee \u00fea saran stowa & Eft gif hie dylstihte sien o\u00f0\u00f0e geborstene genim saluian, seo\u00f0 on w\u00e6tere, be\u00fee mid \u00fea getawa. Eft dile geb\u00e6rned, gemeng wi\u00f0 ahsan hunig, wyrc to sealfe, a\u00feweah \u00feonne & gebe\u00fee \u00fea wunda \u00deis sceal wi\u00fe \u00e6celman & wi\u00f0 \u00feon \u00fee men acale \u00fe\u00e6t fel of \u00feam fotum, genime neo\u00feowearde Wi\u00fe \u00e6lcum heardum swile o\u00f0\u00f0e geswelle adrige beana & geseo\u00fe butan sealte, meng \u00feonne wi\u00f0 Wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan genim beren melo, seo\u00fe on ecede, do on. Eft wi\u00fe \u00feon belenan meng wi\u00f0 rysele, lege on. Wi\u00f0 swile eft gebeat hunan, meng wi\u00fe rysele, lege on o\u00f0\u00f0e gate horn geb\u00e6rned & wi\u00fe w\u00e6ter Eft rysele o\u00fe\u00fee gelyndo wi\u00fe garleac gemenged & on aled \u00feone swile \u00few\u00e6n\u00fe. Wi\u00fe swile eft, cerfille gecnuwad mid rysele & on gemelt weax gedon & on aled bet. Wi\u00f0 swile eft, gate fl\u00e6sc geb\u00e6rned to ahsan mid w\u00e6tere on gesmiten ealne \u00feone swile tof",
